# Cloudflare Pages routing rules (https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/)
#
# The admin editor and the local acquisition tooling are designed for
# curator-only use over `python -m http.server` on localhost. They're
# never meant to be reachable on the deployed site. Return 404 for any
# visitor who pokes at those paths — including the "Sidecar offline"
# leak from the Pending tab.

/admin.html       /404         404
/tools/*          /404         404
/tools            /404         404

# NEW_FILES_LOCAL.md is gitignored already, but list it here too as a
# belt-and-suspenders for any future tracked sibling.
/NEW_FILES_LOCAL.md /404 404
